id: variable
name: Variable
kind: crafting
slots: 1~2
# Another Weapon Size for each Slot, chosen when it is added.
chooses: weaponSize
choosesPerSlot: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Other Sizes, one for each Slot: changed to during your turn with the No Effort Maneuver.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Select an additional Weapon Size upon applying this Weapon Quality for each Quality
  Slot it takes up.

  [Triggered]: During your turn, you can use the No Effort Maneuver to change this Weapon’s
  Weapon Size to another Weapon Size selected upon gaining this Quality or back to its original
  Weapon Size.
text: >
  Variable: This Weapon’s size is larger than most, but smaller than some, allowing it to be
  wielded as if it were of either size.
  –Weapon Type: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1~2
  –Effects: Select an additional Weapon Size upon applying this Weapon Quality for each Quality
  Slot it takes up. During your turn, you can use the No Effort Maneuver to change this Weapon’s
  Weapon Size to another Weapon Size selected upon gaining this Quality or back to its original
  Weapon Size.

---

# Changed from the Weapon's row, and kept until it is changed again. Its Size is what its attacks
# roll with, and - a Shield's - what its Life Points count by.
